 * mood_light.c — Raspberry Pi 3 Model B+
 *
 * Captures 8000 Hz, 16-bit, mono audio via ALSA, computes RMS amplitude,
 * maps it non-linearly to RGB color, and drives a common-cathode RGB LED
 * (GPIO17, GPIO18, GPIO27) via software PWM using the Linux kernel
 * driver library (libgpiod).
